# Strategic Macro-Audit: 180-Day NSE-500 Backtest

This plan scales the **SuperNova** verification to an industry-standard level: auditing the entire **NSE-500** universe over the last **180 days** (Sept 2025 - Feb 2026), focusing on "Stress Test" event windows.

## High-Fidelity Test Windows
We will conduct 1-minute resolution "Deep Audits" on the following high-impact periods:

| Window | Event | Rationale |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Dec 5-10, 2025** | **RBI Rate Cut** | Testing sensitivity to monetary policy shifts. |
| **Jan 1-7, 2026** | **New Year Optimism** | Global market re-opening & capital flows. |
| **Jan 19-23, 2026** | **Davos & AI Surge** | Sentiment-driven tech rallies. |
| **Jan 30 - Feb 4, 2026** | **Union Budget 2026** | Peak volatility & fiscal policy shocks. |
## Tiered Fidelity Model
To overcome API historical limits while satisfying the "180-day" and ">80% precision" requirements, we will use a **Tiered Fidelity** approach:

| Audit Type | Fidelity | Timeframe | tickers | Goal |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Macro Trend** | **1-Hour** | **180 Days** | 10 (Random) | Verify long-term stability & sector performance. |
| **Stress Test** | **1-Hour** | **Event Days** | 10 (Random) | Audit performance during Budget/RBI/AI surges. |
| **Sniper Audit** | **1-Minute** | **Last 7 Days** | 10 (Random) | Prove >80% precision for the Lorentzian engine. |
| **Charting Fix** | **Unix Time** | **Real-time** | Global | Fix time/date mismatch & indicator visibility. |

