## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `python scripts/multi_strategy_backtester.py --windows` to audit event days.
- Run `python scripts/multi_strategy_backtester.py --macro` for the 180-day trend.
- Verify that **Lorentzian Sniper** maintains >80% precision under high-volatility (Budget Day).

### Manual Verification
- Review the **6-Month Performance Report** for consistency across Bull/Bear/Chop regimes.
- Verify sector-specific performance (AI vs Financials) to ensure "Sector Intelligence" is active.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This massive simulation will provide the definitive "Ground Truth" for the system's performance, moving beyond single-day snapshots to a robust 6-month resilience audit.
